sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor E as Engineer
  participant UI as GitBar / CompareView
  participant G as gitOps / compare (main)
  participant A as git-adapter
  participant GH as GitHub
  E->>UI: Compare
  UI->>G: pull()
  G->>A: fetch
  A->>GH: git fetch
  G->>A: merge-tree (in memory): items changed on both sides?
  alt clash
    G-->>UI: "Pull stopped — nothing was changed" + items
  else clean
    G->>A: merge (fast-forward or merge commit)
    G->>G: re-index changed files
    G-->>UI: "Pulled: n items changed"
  end
  UI->>G: compareOptions() → last pull from the reflog
  UI->>G: compareVersions(before, after)
  G->>A: diff --raw (blob IDs) + one cat-file --batch
  G->>G: parse both versions, pair by ID, diffItems
  G-->>UI: per item (added/changed/moved/deleted) + per link
